{"type":"new","contents":"import InfoGeometry.Convex.Bregman\n\n/-!\n# Log Potential\n\nMinimal abstraction for log-partition style potentials.\n-/\n\nnamespace InfoGeometry\n\n/-- A log-partition style potential on parameter space `θ`. -/\nstructure LogPotential (θ : Type _) where\n  ψ : θ → ℝ\n\nnamespace LogPotential\n\n/-- Canonical Bregman divergence generated by a 1D log potential. -/\nnoncomputable def bregman (L : LogPotential ℝ) (η θ₀ : ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  bregmanDiv L.ψ η θ₀\n\n@[simp]\nlemma bregman_def (L : LogPotential ℝ) (η θ₀ : ℝ) :\n    L.bregman η θ₀ = bregmanDiv L.ψ η θ₀ := rfl\n\nend LogPotential\n\nend InfoGeometry\n","mtime":1776602622060}